\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The \textsc  {Kamer}{} sandbox on day\nonbreakingspace 1 of S1, our simulated one-week sitting of December 1899 (composite Binnenhof; agents seeded from public speakers, $N{=}25$). In the Tweede Kamer, a recognised member speaks on the East Indies budget while an unrecognised member is refused the floor. In the wandelgang, Member\nonbreakingspace A tells Member\nonbreakingspace C that the Minister of Colonies may resign (rumour hop\nonbreakingspace 2); a journalist overhears, but the leak does not enter the Handelingen. The minister, in the Department of Colonies, remains unaware. Right: the inspector shows the agent's role, its location in the environment tree, standing-order affordances, retrieved memories, the S1 leak tracker, and researcher controls. No persona is playable.}}{1}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:teaser}{{1}{1}{The \sys {} sandbox on day~1 of S1, our simulated one-week sitting of December 1899 (composite Binnenhof; agents seeded from public speakers, $N{=}25$). In the Tweede Kamer, a recognised member speaks on the East Indies budget while an unrecognised member is refused the floor. In the wandelgang, Member~A tells Member~C that the Minister of Colonies may resign (rumour hop~2); a journalist overhears, but the leak does not enter the Handelingen. The minister, in the Department of Colonies, remains unaware. Right: the inspector shows the agent's role, its location in the environment tree, standing-order affordances, retrieved memories, the S1 leak tracker, and researcher controls. No persona is playable}{figure.caption.1}{}}
