\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces A day in \textsc  {Kamer}{}: Wednesday 20 December 1899 in one heuristic S1 run (seed\nonbreakingspace 19), drawn in the style of Figure\nonbreakingspace \ref {fig:teaser} from the logged state at six moments. Rooms, roles, actions, awareness (purple dot), rumour hops, object states, and utterances come from the run; positions within a room are a layout choice, since the simulation records only the room. Staalman passes the rumour to Seret before the sitting; Seret alludes to it on the floor and the stenographer records the speech; Cremer, the Minister of Colonies, speaks without having heard it and withdraws to his department after the adjournment; the journalist hears the rumour in the wandelgang at 18:00.}}{12}{figure.caption.46}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:day}{{3}{12}{A day in \sys {}: Wednesday 20 December 1899 in one heuristic S1 run (seed~19), drawn in the style of Figure~\ref {fig:teaser} from the logged state at six moments. Rooms, roles, actions, awareness (purple dot), rumour hops, object states, and utterances come from the run; positions within a room are a layout choice, since the simulation records only the room. Staalman passes the rumour to Seret before the sitting; Seret alludes to it on the floor and the stenographer records the speech; Cremer, the Minister of Colonies, speaks without having heard it and withdraws to his department after the adjournment; the journalist hears the rumour in the wandelgang at 18:00}{figure.caption.46}{}}
